title: Sprig Sampler
designer: Wren Holloway
mode: flat
weight: fingering
repeats: 1 across, 1 up
url: https://wrenholloway.example/sampler
note: A small flat swatch: odd rows are right side, worked right to left with the number on the right; even rows are wrong side, worked left to right with the number on the left.
